  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat freezes when I play a video with YUV444 pixel format in AVPro Player and then move the world or exit VRChat.\n\nTest World:\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_260d522f-363f-4775-a391-9724ec1ecb9a\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Enable ALLOW UNTRUSTED URLS in the settings\n2. Join Test World.  \n3. Wait for loading\n4. Open the menu and go to Home.\n5. VRChat freezes.\n\nProblem files:\nhttps://1drv.ms/v/s!AlJeSrNqoNL4aQYm_TfEjKhrBZA?e=HkcYKS\nOr make your own video using ffmpeg.\n ffmpeg -i input.avi -c:v libx264 -pix_fmt yuv444p output_yuv444.mp4\n\nVideo Infomation:\nhttps://pastebin.com/f0LWvXb4\n\nEnvironment:\nWindows10 21H1(19043) x64\nVRChat 1231 (Stable) and 1238 (Live Beta)",
